[Term]
id: HP:0000003
name: Multicystic kidney dysplasia
def: "Multicystic dysplasia of the kidney is characterized by multiple cysts of varying size in the kidney and the absence of a normal pelvicaliceal system." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]
